{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo contains the first 7 out of 55 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Combat and Challenges:</strong> Battle menacing enemies, overcome dangerous obstacles, and escape deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.poster.avif?t=1760106847\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.webm?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.mp4?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Puzzles:</strong> Tackle challenging puzzles that test your assassination skills and strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secretive Environments</strong>: Explore environments filled with secret passageways and off-limit areas, adding depth and intrigue to your missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Tools:</strong> Utilize various tools, including distractions, disguises, hiding spots, traps, portals, and rifles to outsmart your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Types:</strong> Confront enemy types with unique and deadly behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.poster.avif?t=1760106847\" width=624 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.webm?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.mp4?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and Customization:</strong> Collect relics and unlock new outfits for Uhilant, adding a layer of personalization to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals and Soundtrack:</strong> Experience beautifully crafted scale model-style visuals and a relaxing, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Approaches:</strong> Complete each level in various ways\u2014choose to be silent and stealthy or forceful and aggressive. Aim to collect the elusive backpack or finish within a specific number of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Levels:</strong> Enjoy 55 levels that experiment with the game\u2019s mechanics in numerous ways, challenging you to understand and manipulate the rules to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.poster.avif?t=1760106847\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.webm?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.mp4?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Story:</strong> Discover the story of the Uhilant character through the items he carries, adding narrative depth to your journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073330?t=1760106847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073330?t=1760106847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/d35039a6200816f8488f8680fad629b122bb8288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760106847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/d35039a6200816f8488f8680fad629b122bb8288/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760106847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game includes: References to war and conflict in dialogue and story text. Cartoon-style combat where enemies are defeated using firearms and traps. Violence is presented in a stylized, non-graphic way without blood or realistic injury. Occasional themes of oppression, survival, and resistance in a wartime setting, which may be sensitive for some players."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo contains the first 7 out of 55 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Combat and Challenges:</strong> Battle menacing enemies, overcome dangerous obstacles, and escape deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.poster.avif?t=1760106847\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.webm?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.