lent and stealthy or forceful and aggressive. Aim to collect the elusive backpack or finish within a specific number of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Levels:</strong> Enjoy 55 levels that experiment with the game\u2019s mechanics in numerous ways, challenging you to understand and manipulate the rules to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.poster.avif?t=1760106847\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.webm?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.mp4?t=1760106847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Story:</strong> Discover the story of the Uhilant character through the items he carries, adding narrative depth to your journey.</p>","developers":["BoVtik"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3121850","name":"UHILANT"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073330/d261266cec4f0fddc0afbe1290162440fd03af76/header.jpg?t=1760106847","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Bovtik all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4073330/1801300956/da6821581332708ef62d35b29593ea8a71f66ef7/1759177567/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760106845","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4073330/1801300956/da6821581332708ef62d35b29593ea8a71f66ef7/1